{"id":"2.5.2.1","doc":"T","title":"ALU - Perform Arithmetic and Logic Operations","words":782,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ALU (Arithmetic and Logic Unit) performs arithmetic and logic operations on values stored in "},{"t":"block","v":"ULP","id":"ulp"},{"t":"text","v":" coprocessor registers, and on immediate values stored in the instruction itself."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The following operations are supported."}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Arithmetic: ADD and SUB"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Logic: bitwise logical AND and bitwise logical OR"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Bit shifting: LSH and RSH"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Moving data to register: MOVE"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"PC register operations - "},{"t":"field","v":"STAGE_RST"},{"t":"text","v":", "},{"t":"field","v":"STAGE_INC"},{"t":"text","v":", and "},{"t":"field","v":"STAGE_DEC"}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The ALU instruction, which has one OpCode (7), can perform various arithmetic and logic operations, depending on the setting of the instruction bits [27:21]."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operations Among Registers"}]}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-2_5-2.png","alt":"Figure 2.5-2. Instruction Type — ALU for Operations Among Registers"},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When bits [27:26] of the instruction in Figure 2.5-2 are set to 0, ALU performs operations on the data stored in ULP-FSM registers R[0-3]."}]},{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The types of operations depend on the setting of the instruction bits ALU_sel[24:21] presented in Table 2.5-1."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":12,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operand description (see Figure 2.5-2):"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":13,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Register R[0-3], destination"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":14,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Rsrc1"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Register R[0-3], source"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":15,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Rsrc2"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Register R[0-3], source"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":16,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"ALU_sel"}]},{"t":"text","v":": ALU operation selection, see Table 2.5-1"}]}]}]]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 2.5-1. ALU Operations Among Registers","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"ALU_sel"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Instruction"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Operation"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Description"}]],"rows":[{"n":17,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"ADD"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 + Rsrc2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Add to register"}]]},{"n":18,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"SUB"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 - Rsrc2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Subtract from register"}]]},{"n":19,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"AND"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 & Rsrc2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bitwise logical AND of two operands"}]]},{"n":20,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"3"}],[{"t":"text","v":"OR"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 | Rsrc2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bitwise logical OR of two operands"}]]},{"n":21,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"4"}],[{"t":"text","v":"MOVE"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Move to register"}]]},{"n":22,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"5"}],[{"t":"text","v":"LSH"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 << Rsrc2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit shifting left"}]]},{"n":23,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"6"}],[{"t":"text","v":"RSH"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 >> Rsrc2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit shifting right"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":24,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note:"}],"warn":true}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":25,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ADD or SUB operations can be used to set or clear the overflow flag in ALU."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":26,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"All ALU operations can be used to set or clear the zero flag in ALU."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":27,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operations with Immediate Value"}]}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-2_5-3.png","alt":"Figure 2.5-3. Instruction Type — ALU for Operations with Immediate Value"},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":28,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When bits [27:26] of the instruction in Figure 2.5-3 are set to 1, ALU performs operations using register R[0-3] and the immediate value stored in instruction bits [19:4]."}]},{"n":29,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The types of operations depend on the setting of the instruction bits ALU_sel[24:21] presented in Table 2.5-2."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":30,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operand description (see Figure 2.5-3):"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":31,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Register R[0-3], destination"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":32,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Rsrc1"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Register R[0-3], source"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":33,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Imm"}]},{"t":"text","v":": "},{"t":"num","v":"16-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" signed immediate value"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":34,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"ALU_sel"}]},{"t":"text","v":": ALU operation selection, see Table 2.5-2"}]}]}]]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 2.5-2. ALU Operations with Immediate Value","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"ALU_sel"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Instruction"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Operation"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Description"}]],"rows":[{"n":35,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"ADD"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 + Imm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Add to register"}]]},{"n":36,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"SUB"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 - Imm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Subtract from register"}]]},{"n":37,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"AND"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 & Imm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bitwise logical AND of two operands"}]]},{"n":38,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"3"}],[{"t":"text","v":"OR"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 | Imm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bitwise logical OR of two operands"}]]},{"n":39,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"4"}],[{"t":"text","v":"MOVE"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Imm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Move to register"}]]},{"n":40,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"5"}],[{"t":"text","v":"LSH"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 << Imm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit shifting left"}]]},{"n":41,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"6"}],[{"t":"text","v":"RSH"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Rdst = Rsrc1 >> Imm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit shifting right"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":42,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note:"}],"warn":true}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":43,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ADD or SUB operations can be used to set or clear the overflow flag in ALU."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":44,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"All ALU operations can be used to set or clear the zero flag in ALU."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":45,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operations with Stage Count Register"}]}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-2_5-4.png","alt":"Figure 2.5-4. Instruction Type — ALU for Operations with Stage Count Register"},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":46,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ALU is also able to increment or decrement by a given value, or reset the "},{"t":"num","v":"8-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" register Stage_cnt."}]},{"n":47,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"To do so, bits [27:26] of instruction in Figure 2.5-4 should be set to 2."}]},{"n":48,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The type of operation depends on the setting of the instruction bits ALU_sel[24:21] presented in Table 2.5-3."}]},{"n":49,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The Stage_cnt is a separate register and is not a part of the instruction in Figure 2.5-4."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":50,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operand description (see Figure 2.5-4):"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":51,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Imm"}]},{"t":"text","v":": "},{"t":"num","v":"8-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" signed immediate value"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":52,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"ALU_sel"}]},{"t":"text","v":": ALU operation selection, see Table 2.5-3"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":53,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Stage_cnt"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Stage count register, a "},{"t":"num","v":"8-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" separate register used to store variables, such as loop index"}]}]}]]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 2.5-3. ALU Operations with Stage Count Register","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"ALU_sel"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Instruction"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Operation"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Description"}]],"rows":[{"n":54,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"field","v":"STAGE_INC"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Stage_cnt = Stage_cnt + Imm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Increment stage count register"}]]},{"n":55,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"field","v":"STAGE_DEC"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Stage_cnt = Stage_cnt - Imm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Decrement stage count register"}]]},{"n":56,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"2"}],[{"t":"field","v":"STAGE_RST"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Stage_cnt = 0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Reset stage count register"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":57,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note: This instruction is mainly used with JUMPS instruction based on the stage count register to form a stage count for-loop."}],"warn":true},{"n":58,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For the usage, please refer to the following pseudocode:"}]}]},{"t":"pre","v":"STAGE_RST                                   // clear stage count register\nSTAGE_INC                                   // stage count register ++\n{...}                                       // loop body, containing n instructions\nJUMPS (step = n, cond = 0, threshold = m)   // If the value of stage count register is less than m, then jump to\n                                            // STAGE_INC, otherwise jump out of the loop. By such way, a\n                                            // cumulative for-loop with threshold m is implemented."}]}